e specific category UUIDs. Predefined values include: 'Other apps', 'Books \u0026 Reference', 'Data management', 'Productivity', 'Business', 'Development \u0026 Design', 'Photos \u0026 Media', 'Collaboration \u0026 Social', 'Computer management'.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"content_version":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"files":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"azure_storage_uri":{"type":"string","description":"Indicates the Azure Storage URI that the file is uploaded to. Read-only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"azure_storage_uri_expiration":{"type":"string","description":"Indicates the date and time when the Azure storage URI expires, in ISO 8601 format. Read-only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"created_date_time":{"type":"string","description":"Indicates created date and time associated with app content file, in ISO 8601 format. Read-only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"is_committed":{"type":"bool","description":"A value indicating whether the file is committed. A committed app content file has been fully uploaded and validated by the Intune service. Read-only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"is_dependency":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates whether this content file is a dependency for the main content file.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"is_framework_file":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates whether this content file is a framework file.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"name":{"type":"string","description":"Indicates the name of the file.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"size":{"type":"number","description":"Indicates the original size of the file, in bytes.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"size_encrypted":{"type":"number","description":"Indicates the size of the file after encryption, in bytes.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"upload_state":{"type":"string","description":"Indicates the state of the current upload request. This property is read-only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true}},"nesting_mode":"set"},"description":"The files associated with this content version.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"id":{"type":"string","description":"The unique identifier for this content version. This ID is assigned during creation of the content version. Read-only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true}},"nesting_mode":"list"},"description":"The committed content version of the app, including its files. Only the currently committed version is shown.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"created_date_time":{"type":"string","description":"The date and time the app was created. This property is read-only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"dependent_app_count":{"type":"number","description":"The total number of dependencies the child app has. This property is read-only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"description":{"type":"string","description":"Required. The description of the resource. Maximum length is 10000 characters.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"developer":{"type":"string","description":"The developer of the app.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"display_name":{"type":"string","description":"The title of the Intune macOS DMG application.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"id":{"type":"string","description":"The unique identifier of the macOS DMG app.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"information_url":{"type":"string","description":"The more information Url.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"is_assigned":{"type":"bool","description":"The value indicating whether the app is assigned to at least one group. This property is read-only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"is_featured":{"type":"bool","description":"The value indicating whether the app is marked as featured by the admin.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"macos_dmg_app":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"ignore_version_detection":{"type":"bool","description":"When TRUE, indicates that the app's version will NOT be used to detect if the app is installed on a device. When FALSE, indicates that the app's version will be used to detect if the app is installed on a device. Set this to true for apps that use a self update feature. The default value is FALSE.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"included_apps":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"bundle_id":{"type":"string","description":"The `CFBundleIdentifier` of the app as defined in the DMG metadata or appended manually.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"bundle_version":{"type":"string","description":"The `CFBundleShortVersionString` of the app as defined in the DMG metadata or appended manually.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true}},"nesting_mode":"set"},"description":"Define the app bundle identifiers and version numbers to be used to detect the presence of the macOS app installation. This list is dynamically populated based on the DMG metadata, and users can also append additional entries. Maximum of 500 apps.\n\n### Notes:\n- Included app bundle IDs (`CFBundleIdentifier`) and build numbers (`CFBundleShortVersionString`) are used for detecting and monitoring app installation status of the uploaded file.\n- The list should **only** contain the application(s) installed by the uploaded file in the `/Applications` folder on macOS.\n- Any other type of file that is not an application or is not installed in the `/Applications` folder should **not** be included.\n- If the list contains files that are not applications or none of the listed apps are installed, app installation status will **not** report success.\n- When multiple apps are present in the DMG, the **first app** in the list is used to identify the application.\n\n### Example:\nTo retrieve the `CFBundleIdentifier` and `CFBundleShortVersionString` of an installed application, you can use the macOS Terminal:\n\n```bash\n# Retrieve the Bundle Identifier\ndefaults read /Applications/Company\\ Portal.app/Contents/Info CFBundleIdentifier\n\n# Retrieve the Short Version String\ndefaults read /Applications/Company\\ Portal.app/Contents/Info CFBundleShortVersionString\n```\n\nAlternatively, these values can also be located in the `\u003capp_name\u003e.app/Contents/Info.plist` file inside the mounted DMG.\n\nFor apps added to Intune, the Intune admin center can also provide the app bundle ID.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"minimum_supported_operating_system":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"v10_10":{"type":"bool","description":"Application supports macOS 10.10 or later. Defaults to `false`.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"v10_11":{"type":"bool","description":"Application supports macOS 10.11 or later. Defaults to `false`.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"v10_12":{"type":"bool","description":"Application supports macOS 10.12 or later. Defaults to `false`.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"v10_13":{"type":"bool","description":"Application supports macOS 10.13 or later. Defaults to `false`.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"v10_14":{"type":"bool","description":"Application supports macOS 10.14 or later. Defaults to `false`.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"v10_15":{"type":"bool","description":"Application supports macOS 10.15 or later. Defaults to `false`.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"v10_7":{"type":"bool","description":"Application supports macOS 10.7 or later. Defaults to `false`.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"v10_8":{"type":"bool","description":"Application supports macOS 10.8 or later. Defaults to `false`.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"v10_9":{"type":"bool","description":"Application supports macOS 10.9 or later. Defaults to `false`.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"v11_0":{"type":"bool","description":"Application supports macOS 11.0 or later. Defaults to `false`.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"v12_0":{"type":"bool","description":"Application supports macOS 12.0 or later. Defaults to `false`.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"v13_0":{"type":"bool","description":"Application supports macOS 13.0 or later. Defaults to `false`.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"v14_0":{"type":"bool","description":"Application supports macOS 14.0 or later. Defaults to `false`.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"v15_0":{"type":"bool","description":"Application supports macOS 15.0 or later. Defaults to `false`.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"Specifies the minimum macOS version required for the application. Each field indicates whether the version is supported.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"primary_bundle_id":{"type":"string","description":"The bundleId of the primary app in the DMG. Maps to CFBundleIdentifier in the app's bundle configuration.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"primary_bundle_version":{"type":"string","description":"The version of the primary app in the DMG. Maps to CFBundleShortVersion in the app's bundle configuration.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"The path to the DMG file to be uploaded. Resource supports both local file sources and URL based sources.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"notes":{"type":"string","description":"Notes for the app.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"owner":{"type":"string","description":"The owner of the app.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"privacy_information_url":{"type":"string","description":"The privacy statement Url.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"publisher":{"type":"string","description":"The publisher of the Intune macOS DMG application.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"publishing_state":{"type":"string","description":"The publishing state for the app. The app cannot be assigned unless the app is published. Possible values are: notPublished, processing, published.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"relationships":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"The unique identifier for the relationship.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"source_display_name":{"type":"string","description":"The display name of the source application in the relationship.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"source_display_version":{"type":"string","description":"The display version of the source application in the relationship.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"source_id":{"type":"string","description":"The unique identifier of the source application in the relationship.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"source_publisher_display_name":{"type":"string","description":"The display name of the source application's publisher in the relationship.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"target_display_name":{"type":"string","description":"The display name of the target application in the relationship.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"target_display_version":{"type":"string","description":"The display version of the target application in the relationship.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"target_id":{"type":"string","description":"The unique identifier of the target application in the relationship.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"target_publisher":{"type":"string","description":"The 