A string that can be [parsed as a duration](https://pkg.go.dev/time#ParseDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours). Read operations occur during any refresh or planning operation when refresh is enabled.","description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"update":{"type":"string","description":"A string that can be [parsed as a duration](https://pkg.go.dev/time#ParseDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours).","description_kind":"plain","optional":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"upload_state":{"type":"number","description":"The upload state. Possible values are: 0 - Not Ready, 1 - Ready, 2 - Processing. This property is read-only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true}},"description":"Manages a macOS DMG (Apple Disk Image) app deployment in Microsoft Intune using the `/deviceAppManagement/mobileApps` endpoint. This resource is used to deploy macOS applications contained in DMG files to managed devices. DMG files contain one or more .app files that are automatically extracted and installed to the /Applications folder on managed macOS devices via the Intune management agent.","description_kind":"markdown"}},"microsoft365_graph_beta_device_and_app_management_macos_lob_app":{"version":0,"block":{"attributes":{"app_icon":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"icon_file_path_source":{"type":"string","description":"The file path to the icon file to be uploaded. Supports various image formats which will be automatically converted to PNG.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"icon_url_source":{"type":"string","description":"The web location of the icon file, can be a http(s) URL. Supports various image formats which will be automatically converted to PNG.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true}},"nesting_m