eference', 'Data management', 'Productivity', 'Business', 'Development \u0026 Design', 'Photos \u0026 Media', 'Collaboration \u0026 Social', 'Computer management'.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"content_version":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"files":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"azure_storage_uri":{"type":"string","description":"Indicates the Azure Storage URI that the file is uploaded to. Read-only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"azure_storage_uri_expiration":{"type":"string","description":"Indicates the date and time when the Azure storage URI expires, in ISO 8601 format. Read-only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"created_date_time":{"type":"string","description":"Indicates created date and time associated with app content file, in ISO 8601 format. Read-only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"is_committed":{"type":"bool","description":"A value indicating whether the file is committed. A committed app content file has been fully uploaded and validated by the Intune service. Read-only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"is_dependency":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates whether this content file is a dependency for the main content file.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"is_framework_file":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates whether this content file is a framework file.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"name":{"type":"string","description":"Indicates the name of the file.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"size":{"type":"number","description":"Indicates the original size of the file, in bytes.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"size_encrypted":{"type":"number","description":"Indicates the size of the file after encryption, in bytes.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"upload_state":{"type":"string","description":"Indicates the state of the current upload request. This property is read-only.","description_k