n) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours). Read operations occur during any refresh or planning operation when refresh is enabled.","description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"update":{"type":"string","description":"A string that can be [parsed as a duration](https://pkg.go.dev/time#ParseDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours).","description_kind":"plain","optional":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"total_license_count":{"type":"number","description":"The total number of VPP licenses.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"upload_state":{"type":"number","description":"The upload state. Possible values are: 0 - Not Ready, 1 - Ready, 2 - Processing. This property is read-only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"used_license_count":{"type":"number","description":"The number of VPP licenses in use.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"vpp_token_account_type":{"type":"string","description":"The type of volume purchase program which the given Apple Volume Purchase Program Token is associated with. Possible values are: business, education.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"vpp_token_apple_id":{"type":"string","description":"The Apple Id associated with the given Apple Volume Purchase Program Token.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"vpp_token_display_name":{"type":"string","description":"Display name of the VPP token associated with this app.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"vpp_token_id":{"type":"string","description":"Identifier of the VPP token associated with this app.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"vpp_token_organization_name":{"type":"string","description":"The organization associated with the Apple Volume Purchase Program Token.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true}},"description":"Manages macOS Volume-Purchased Program (VPP) apps using the `/deviceAppManagement/mobileApps` endpoint. This resource is used to vPP apps are applications purchased through Apple's Volume Purchase Program that can be distributed to managed macOS devices through the Intune management agent.","description_kind":"markdown"}},"microsoft365_graph_beta_device_and_app_management_mobile_app_assignment":{"version":1,"block":{"attributes":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"The ID of the app assignment associated with the Intune application.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"intent":{"type":"string","description":"The Intune app install intent defined by the admin. Possible values are:\n\n- **available**: App is available for users to install\n- **required**: App is required and will be automatically installed\n- **uninstall**: App will be uninstalled\n- **availableWithoutEnrollment**: App is available without Intune device enrollment","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"mobile_app_id":{"type":"string","description":"The ID of the mobile app to attach the assignment to.","description_kind":"plain","required":true},"settings":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"android_managed_store":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"android_managed_store_app_track_ids":{"type":["list","string"],"description":"The track IDs to enable for this app assignment.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"auto_update_mode":{"type":"string","description":"The prioritization of automatic updates for this app assignment. Possible values are:\n\n- **default**: Default auto-update mode\n- **postponed**: Updates are postponed\n- **priority**: Updates are prioritized\n- **unknownFutureValue**: Reserved for future use","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"ios_lob":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"is_removable":{"type":"bool","description":"When TRUE, indicates that the app can be uninstalled by the user. When FALSE, indicates that the app cannot be uninstalled by the user. Only supported when `intent` is `required`; the Intune service rejects this setting for every other intent. When omitted the setting is not sent and the service default (TRUE) applies.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"prevent_managed_app_backup":{"type":"bool","description":"When TRUE, indicates that the app should not be backed up to iCloud. When FALSE, indicates that the app may be backed up to iCloud. Cannot be set when `intent` is `uninstall`. When omitted the setting is not sent and the service default (FALSE) applies.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"uninstall_on_device_removal":{"type":"bool","description":"When TRUE, indicates that the app should be uninstalled when the device is removed from Intune. When FALSE, indicates that the app will not be uninstalled when the device is removed from Intune. Cannot be set when `intent` is `uninstall`. When omitted the setting is not sent and the service default (TRUE) applies.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"vpn_configuration_id":{"type":"string","description":"This is the unique identifier (Id) of the VPN Configuration to apply to the app.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"ios_store":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"is_removable":{"type":"bool","description":"When TRUE, indicates that the app can be uninstalled by the user. When FALSE, indicates that the app cannot be uninstalled by the user. Only supported when `intent` is `required`; the Intune service rejects this setting for every other intent. When omitted the setting is not sent and the service default (TRUE) applies.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"prevent_managed_app_backup":{"type":"bool","description":"When TRUE, indicates that the app should not be backed up to iCloud. When FALSE, indicates that the app may be backed up to iCloud. Cannot be set when `intent` is `uninstall`. When omitted the setting is not sent and the service default (FALSE) applies.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"uninstall_on_device_removal":{"type":"bool","description":"When TRUE, indicates that the app should be uninstalled when the device is removed from Intune. When FALSE, indicates that the app will not be uninstalled when the device is removed from Intune. Cannot be set when `intent` is `uninstall`. When omitted the setting is not sent and the service default (TRUE) applies.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"vpn_configuration_id":{"type":"string","description":"This is the unique identifier (Id) of the VPN Configuration to apply to the app.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"ios_vpp":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"is_removable":{"type":"bool","description":"Whether or not the app can be removed by the user. Only supported when `intent` is `required`; the Intune service rejects this setting for every other intent. When omitted the setting is not sent and the service default (FALSE) applies.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"prevent_auto_app_update":{"type":"bool","description":"When TRUE, indicates that the app should not be automatically updated with the latest version from Apple app store. When FALSE, indicates that the app may be auto updated. When omitted the setting is not sent and the service default (FALSE) applies.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"prevent_managed_app_backup":{"type":"bool","description":"When TRUE, indicates that the app should not be backed up to iCloud. When FALSE, indicates that the app may be backed up to iCloud. Cannot be set when `intent` is `uninstall`. When omitted the setting is not sent and the service default (FALSE) applies.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"uninstall_on_device_removal":{"type":"bool","description":"Whether or not to uninstall the app when device is removed from Intune. Cannot be set when `intent` is `uninstall`. When omitted the setting is not sent and the service default (FALSE) applies.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"use_device_licensing":{"type":"bool","description":"Whether or not to use device licensing. When omitted the setting is not sent and the service default (FALSE, user licensing) applies.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"vpn_configuration_id":{"type":"string","description":"The VPN Configuration Id to apply for this app.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"macos_lob":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"uninstall_on_device_removal":{"type":"bool","description":"When TRUE, the macOS LOB app will be uninstalled when the device is removed from Intune management. When FALSE, the macOS LOB app will not be uninstalled when the device is removed from management. By default, this property is set to FALSE.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"macos_vpp":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"prevent_auto_app_update":{"type":"bool","description":"When TRUE, indicates that the app should not be automatically updated with the latest version from Apple app store. When FALSE, indicates that the app may be auto updated. By default, this property is set to null which internally is treated as FALSE.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"prevent_managed_app_backup":{"type":"bool","description":"When TRUE, indicates that the app should not be backed up to iCloud. When FALSE, indicates that the app may be backed up to iCloud. By default, this property is set to null which internally is treated as FALSE.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"u