rkdown","computed":true},"supersedence_type":{"type":"string","description":"The supersedence relationship type between the parent and child apps. Possible values are: update, replace.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"superseding_app_count":{"type":"number","description":"The total number of apps directly or indirectly superseding the parent app. Read-Only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"target_display_name":{"type":"string","description":"The display name of the app that is the target of the mobile app relationship entity. For example: Firefox Setup 52.0.2 32bit.intunewin. Maximum length is 500 characters. Read-Only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"target_display_version":{"type":"string","description":"The display version of the app that is the target of the mobile app relationship entity. For example 1.0 or 1.2203.156. Read-Only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"target_id":{"type":"string","description":"The unique app identifier of the target of the mobile app relationship entity. For example: 2dbc75b9-e993-4e4d-a071-91ac5a218672.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"target_publisher":{"type":"string","description":"The publisher of the app that is the target of the mobile app relationship entity. For example: Fabrikam. Maximum length is 500 characters. Read-Only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"target_publisher_display_name":{"type":"string","description":"The publisher display name of the app that is the target of the mobile app relationship entity. For example: Fabrikam. Maximum length is 500 characters. Read-Only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"target_type":{"type":"string","description":"The type of relationship indicating whether the target application of a relationship is a parent or child in the relationship. Possible values are: parent, child. Read-Only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"timeouts":{"nested_type":{"attributes":