is false.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"groove":{"type":"bool","description":"The value for if MS Office OneDrive for Business – Groove should be excluded or not. Default is false.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"info_path":{"type":"bool","description":"The value for if MS Office InfoPath should be excluded or not. Default is false.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"lync":{"type":"bool","description":"The value for if MS Office Skype for Business – Lync should be excluded or not. Default is false.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"one_drive":{"type":"bool","description":"The value for if MS Office OneDrive should be excluded or not. Default is false.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"one_note":{"type":"bool","description":"The value for if MS Office OneNote should be excluded or not. Default is false.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"outlook":{"type":"bool","description":"The value for if MS Office Outlook should be excluded or not. Default is false.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"power_point":{"type":"bool","description":"The value for if MS Office PowerPoint should be excluded or not. Default is false.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"publisher":{"type":"bool","description":"The value for if MS Office Publisher should be excluded or not. Default is false.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"share_point_designer":{"type":"bool","description":"The value for if MS Office SharePoint Designer should be excluded or not. Default is false.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"teams":{"type":"bool","description":"The value for if MS Office Teams should be excluded or not. Default is false.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"visio":{"type":"bool","description":"The value for if MS Office Visio should be excluded or not. Default is false.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"word":{"type":"bool","description":"The value for if MS Office Word should be excluded or not. Default is false.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"The Office applications to exclude from the installation.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"locales_to_install":{"type":["set","string"],"description":"By default, Intune will install Office with the default language of the operating system. Choose any additional languages that you want to install.Must be one of the supported Office locale codes in the format 'xx-xx' (e.g., 'en-us', 'ja-jp').","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"office_platform_architecture":{"type":"string","description":"The architecture for which to install Office. Possible values are: 'x86', 'x64'. Default is 'x64'. Changing this forces a new resource to be created.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"office_suite_app_default_file_format":{"type":"string","description":"The default file format for Office applications. Possible values are: 'officeOpenXMLFormat', 'officeOpenDocumentFormat'.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"product_ids":{"type":["set","string"],"description":"The Product IDs that represent the Office suite app. Example values: 'o365ProPlusRetail', 'o365BusinessRetail','projectProRetail', 'visioProRetail'.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"should_uninstall_older_versions_of_office":{"type":"bool","description":"The value to uninstall any existing MSI versions of Office. Default is false.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"target_version":{"type":"string","description":"The specific version of Office to install. Example: '16.0.19029.20244'.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"update_channel":{"type":"string","description":"The Office update channel. Possible values are: 'current', 'deferred', 'firstReleaseCurrent', 'firstReleaseDeferred', 'monthlyEnterprise'.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"update_version":{"type":"string","description":"The specific update version for the Office installation. Example: '2507'. For latest version, use empty string (default).","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"use_shared_computer_activation":{"type":"bool","description":"The value to enable shared computer activation for Office. Shared computer activation lets you deploy Microsoft 365 Apps to computers that are used by multiple users. Normally, users can only install and activate Microsoft 365 Apps on a limited number of devices, such as 5 PCs. Using Microsoft 365 Apps with shared computer activation doesn't count against that limit. Default is false.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"Configuration Designer block for Office Suite App. Use this to configure Office applications using individual settings.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"created_date_time":{"type":"string","description":"The date and time the app was created. This property is read-only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"dependent_app_count":{"type":"number","description":"The total number of dependencies the child app has. This property is read-only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"description":{"type":"string","description":"Required. The description of the resource. Maximum length is 10000 characters.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"developer":{"type":"string","description":"The developer of the app.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"display_name":{"type":"string","description":"The title of the Microsoft 365 Apps application.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"id":{"type":"string