ncludeCompanyName, includeContactInformation, includeCompanyPortalLink, includeDeviceDetails. Defaults to ['none'].","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"default_locale":{"type":"string","description":"The default locale to fallback onto when the requested locale is not available","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"display_name":{"type":"string","description":"Display name for the notification message template","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"id":{"type":"string","description":"Manages notification message templates in Microsoft Intune using the `/deviceManagement/notificationMessageTemplates` endpoint. Notification message templates define the content and branding of compliance notifications sent to users.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"last_modified_date_time":{"type":"string","description":"DateTime the notification message template was last modified","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"localized_notification_messages":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"Unique identifier for the localized notification message","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"is_default":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if this is the default message for the template","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"locale":{"type":"string","description":"The locale for the notification message (e.g., 'en-us'). Must be in lowercase format.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"message_template":{"type":"string","description":"The message template text that can include tokens like {DeviceName}, {UserName}, etc.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"subject":{"type":"string","description":"The subject of the notification message","description_kind":"markdown","required":true}},"nesting_mode":"set"},"description":"The list of localized notification messages for this template","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"role_scope_tag_ids":{"type":["set","string"],"description":"List of scope tag IDs for this notification message template","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"timeouts":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"create":{"type":"string","description":"A string that can be [parsed as a duration](https://pkg.go.dev/time#ParseDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours).","description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"delete":{"type":"string","description":"A string that can be [parsed as a duration](https://pkg.go.dev/time#ParseDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours). Setting a timeout for a Delete operation is only applicable if changes are saved into state before the destroy operation occurs.","description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"read":{"type":"string","description":"A string that can be [parsed as a duration](https://pkg.go.dev/time#ParseDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours). Read operations occur during any refresh or planning operation when refresh is enabled.","description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"update":{"type":"string","description":"A string that can be [parsed as a duration](https://pkg.go.dev/time#ParseDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours).","description_kind":"plain","optional":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description_kind":"plain","optional":true}},"description":"Manages an Intune notification message template for compliance notifications","description_kind":"markdown"}},"microsoft365_graph_beta_device_management_device_enrollment_limit_configuration":{"version":0,"block":{"attributes":{"created_date_time":{"type":"string","description":"Created date time in UTC of the device enrollment configuration. This property is read-only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"description":{"type":"string","description":"Optional description of the resource. Maximum length is 1500 characters.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"device_enrollment_configuration_type":{"type":"string","description":"Support for Enrollment Configuration Type. Possible values are: `unknown`, `limit`, `platformRestrictions`, `windowsHelloForBusiness`, `defaultLimit`, `defaultPlatformRestrictions`, `defaultWindowsHelloForBusiness`, `defaultWindows10EnrollmentCompletionPageConfiguration`, `windows10EnrollmentCompletionPageConfiguration`, `deviceComanagementAuthorityConfiguration`, `singlePlatformRestriction`, `unknownFutureValue`, `enrollmentNotificationsConfiguration`, `windowsRestore`.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"display_name":{"type":"string","description":"The display name of the device enrollment configuration.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"id":{"type":"string","description":"The unique identifier of the device enrollment limit configuration.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"last_modified_date_time":{"type":"string","description":"Last modified date time in UTC of the device enrollment configuration. This property is read-only.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"limit":{"type":"number","description":"The maximum number of devices that a user can enroll.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"priority":{"type":"number","description":"Priority is used when a user exists in multiple groups that are assigned enrollment configuration. Users are subject only to the configuration with the lowest priority value.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"role_scope_tag_ids":{"type":["set","string"],"description":"Optional role scope tags for the enrollment restrictions.","description_kind":"markdown",