ion](https://pkg.go.dev/time#ParseDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours). Setting a timeout for a Delete operation is only applicable if changes are saved into state before the destroy operation occurs.","description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"read":{"type":"string","description":"A string that can be [parsed as a duration](https://pkg.go.dev/time#ParseDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours). Read operations occur during any refresh or planning operation when refresh is enabled.","description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"update":{"type":"string","description":"A string that can be [parsed as a duration](https://pkg.go.dev/time#ParseDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours).","description_kind":"plain","optional":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description_kind":"plain","optional":true}},"description":"Manages a device custom attribute shell script using the `/deviceManagement/deviceCustomAttributeShellScripts` endpoint. This resource is used to configure a device custom attribute shell script settings.","description_kind":"markdown"}},"microsoft365_graph_beta_device_management_macos_dep_enrollment_profile":{"version":0,"block":{"attributes":{"accessibility_screen_disabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the Accessibility screen is disabled.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"admin_account_full_name":{"type":"string","description":"The full name for the auto-created local admin account.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"admin_account_password":{"type":"string","description":"The password for the auto-created local admin account. This is a write-only, sensitive value and is never returned by the Graph API.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"sensitive":true,"write_only":true},"admin_account_password_rotation":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"auto_rotation_period_in_days":{"type":"number","description":"The number of days between automatic admin account password rotations.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"on_retrieval_auto_rotate_password_enabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates whether the password is automatically rotated after retrieval.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"on_retrieval_delay_auto_rotate_password_in_hours":{"type":"number","description":"The delay in hours before automatically rotating the password after retrieval.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"Settings for local admin account password automatic rotation (depProfileAdminAccountPasswordRotationSetting).","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"admin_account_user_name":{"type":"string","description":"The user name (short name) for the auto-created local admin account.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"apple_id_disabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the Apple ID setup pane is disabled.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"apple_pay_disabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the Apple Pay setup pane is disabled.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"auto_advance_setup_enabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if Setup Assistant will automatically advance through its screens.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"auto_unlock_with_watch_disabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the Unlock With Watch screen is disabled.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"await_device_configured":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the device will need to wait for configured confirmation (the desktop is gated until MDM configuration finishes). Maps to `waitForDeviceConfiguredConfirmation`.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"choose_your_lock_screen_disabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the Choose Your Lock Screen screen is disabled.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"configuration_endpoint_url":{"type":"string","description":"Configuration endpoint url to use for enrollment. Generated by Intune.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"configuration_web_url":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the admin-assisted setup assistant login (web-based authentication) URL is used. Cannot be true when `use_platform_sso_during_setup_assistant` is true.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"dep_onboarding_settings_id":{"type":"string","description":"Identifier of the parent depOnboardingSetting (Apple ABM/ASM ADE token) that contains this macOS DEP enrollment profile. If omitted, the provider auto-resolves it by listing `/deviceManagement/depOnboardingSettings` and selecting the Apple ADE/ABM token (`tokenType` = `dep`) or ASM token (`tokenType` = `appleSchoolManager`), ignoring Apple Configurator tokens. Set this explicitly only if your tenant has more than one Apple DEP token (auto-resolution is ambiguous in that case).","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"description":{"type":"string","description":"Description of the profile. Maximum length is 1500 characters.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"device_name_template":{"type":"string","description":"Sets a literal or name pattern for the device name.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"diagnostics_disabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the Diagnostics setup pane is disabled.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"display_name":{"type":"string","description":"Name of the profile displayed in Intune.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"display_tone_setup_disabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the DisplayTone setup screen is disabled.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"dont_auto_populate_primary_account_info":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates whether Setup Assistant will auto-populate the primary account information.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"enable_authentication_via_company_portal":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates to authenticate with the Company Portal instead of Apple Setup Assistant.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"enable_restrict_editing":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates whether the user will be blocked from editing the account.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"enabled_skip_keys":{"type":["set","string"],"description":"Computed, read-only set of Setup Assistant skip keys (Apple `SkipKeys`) that the provider sends to Graph. This is derived from the individual `*_disabled` boolean attributes; do not set it directly. Note: `Privacy` and `Registration` are intentionally omitted from this array because the Microsoft Graph API rejects those skip-key strings, even though the `privacy_pane_disabled` and `registration_disabled` boolean properties work correctly.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"enrollment_time_azure_ad_group_ids":{"type":["set","string"],"description":"List of enrollment-time Microsoft Entra (Azure AD) group GUIDs to be associated with the profile.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"file_vault_disabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if FileVault is disabled.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"hide_admin_account":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates whether the local admin account should be hidden.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"icloud_diagnostics_disabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the iCloud Analytics screen is disabled.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"icloud_storage_disabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the iCloud Documents and Desktop screen is disabled.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"id":{"type":"string","description":"The unique identifier of the enrollment profile. Format is `{depOnboardingSettingsId}_{profileId}`.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"is_default":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if this is the default profile.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"is_mandatory":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the profile is mandatory.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"location_disabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the Location service setup pane is disabled.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"pass_code_disabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the Passcode setup pane is disabled.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"primary_account_full_name":{"type":"string","description":"The full name for the primary account.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"primary_account_user_name":{"type":"string","description":"The account name (short name) for the primary account.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"privacy_pane_disabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the Privacy screen is disabled.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"profile_removal_disabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the profile removal option is disabled.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"registration_disabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if registration is disabled.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"request_requires_network_tether":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the device is network-tethered to run the command.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"require_company_portal_on_setup_assistant_enrolled_devices":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates that the Company Portal is required on setup assistant enrolled devices.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"requires_user_authentication":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the profile requires user authentication.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"restore_blocked":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the Restore setup pane is blocked.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"screen_time_screen_disabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the Screen Time setup screen is disabled.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"set_primary_setup_account_as_regular_user":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates whether Setup Assistant will set the primary account as a regular (non-admin) user.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"siri_disabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the Siri setup pane is disabled.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"skip_primary_setup_account_creation":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates whether Setup Assistant will skip the user interface for primary account setup.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"supervised_mode_enabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Supervised mode. True to enable, false otherwise.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"support_department":{"type":"string","description":"Support department information.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"support_phone_number":{"type":"string","description":"Support phone number.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"terms_and_conditions_disabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the 'Terms and Conditions' setup pane is disabled.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"timeouts":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"create":{"type":"string","description":"A string that can be [parsed as a duration](https://pkg.go.dev/time#ParseDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours).","description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"delete":{"type":"string","description":"A string that can be [parsed as a duration](https://pkg.go.dev/time#ParseDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours). Setting a timeout for a Delete operation is only applicable if changes are saved into state before the destroy operation occurs.","description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"read":{"type":"string","description":"A string that can be [parsed as a duration](https://pkg.go.dev/time#ParseDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours). Read operations occur during any refresh or planning operation when refresh is enabled.","description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"update":{"type":"string","description":"A string that can be [parsed as a duration](https://pkg.go.dev/time#ParseDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours).","description_kind":"plain","optional":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"touch_id_disabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Indicates if the Touch ID setup pane is disabled.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true