 operation occurs.","description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"read":{"type":"string","description":"A string that can be [parsed as a duration](https://pkg.go.dev/time#ParseDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours). Read operations occur during any refresh or planning operation when refresh is enabled.","description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"update":{"type":"string","description":"A string that can be [parsed as a duration](https://pkg.go.dev/time#ParseDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours).","description_kind":"plain","optional":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description_kind":"plain","optional":true}},"description":"Manages a Windows 10 Enrollment Status Page configuration in Microsoft Intune. Using the `/deviceManagement/deviceEnrollmentConfigurations/{deviceEnrollmentConfigurationId}` endpoint.The Enrollment Status Page (ESP) displays the progress of the device setup process during Windows Autopilot provisioning or when a device first enrolls in Microsoft Intune.","description_kind":"markdown"}},"microsoft365_graph_beta_device_management_windows_feature_update_policy":{"version":0,"block":{"attributes":{"assignments":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"group_id":{"type":"string","description":"The Entra ID group ID to include or exclude in the assignment. Required when type is 'groupAssignmentTarget' or 'exclusionGroupAssignmentTarget'.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"type":{"type":"string","description":"Type of assignment target. Must be one of: 'allDevicesAssignmentTarget', 'allLicensedUsersAssignmentTarget', 'groupAssignmentTarget', 'exclusionGroupAssignmentTarget'.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true}},"nesting_mode":"set"},"description":"Assignments for the Windows Software Update Policies. Each assignment specifies the target group and schedule for script execution.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"created_date_time":{"type":"string","description":"The date time that the profile was created.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"deployable_content_display_name":{"type":"string","description":"Friendly display name of the quality update profile deployable content","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"description":{"type":"string","description":"Optional description of the resource. Maximum length is 1500 characters.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"display_name":{"type":"string","description":"The display name of the profile.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"end_of_support_date":{"type":"string","description":"The last supported date for a feature update","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"feature_update_version":{"type":"string","description":"The feature update version that will be deployed to the devices targeted by this profile. Valid values are: \"Windows 11, version 25H2\", \"Windows 11, version 24H2\", \"Windows 11, version 23H2\". By selecting this Feature update to deploy you are agreeing that when applying this operating system to a device either (1) the applicable Windows license was purchased though volume licensing, or (2) that you are authorized to bind your organization and are accepting on its behalf the relevant Microsoft Software License Terms to be found here https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2171206.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"id":{"type":"string","description":"The Identifier of the entity.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"install_feature_updates_optional":{"type":"bool","description":"If true, the Windows 11 update will become available to users as an optional update. If false, the Windows 11 update will become available to users as a required update","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed"