,"membership_kind":{"type":"string","description":"Kind of membership. Possible values are: all, enumerated, unknownFutureValue.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"Configuration for external tenants.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"guest_or_external_user_types":{"type":["set","string"],"description":"Types of guests or external users to exclude. Possible values are: InternalGuest, B2bCollaborationGuest, B2bCollaborationMember, B2bDirectConnectUser, OtherExternalUser, ServiceProvider.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"Configuration for excluding guests or external users.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"exclude_roles":{"type":["set","string"],"description":"Microsoft Entra tenant roles to exclude from the policy.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"exclude_users":{"type":["set","string"],"description":"Users to exclude from the policy. Can use special values like 'GuestsOrExternalUsers'.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"include_groups":{"type":["set","string"],"description":"Groups to include in the policy.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"include_guests_or_external_users":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"external_tenants":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"members":{"type":["set","string"],"description":"The list of Microsoft Entra organization tenant IDs for external tenants to exclude from the CA policy.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"membership_kind":{"type":"string","description":"Kind of membership. Possible values are: all, enumerated, unknownFutureValue.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"Configuration for external tenants.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"guest_or_external_user_types":{"type":["set","string"],"description":"Types of guests or external users to include. Possible values are: InternalGuest, B2bCollaborationGuest, B2bCollaborationMember, B2bDirectConnectUser, OtherExternalUser, ServiceProvider.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"Configuration for including guests or external users.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"include_roles":{"type":["set","string"],"description":"Roles to include in the policy.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"include_users":{"type":["set","string"],"description":"Users to include in the policy. Can use special values like 'All', 'None', or 'GuestsOrExternalUsers'.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"Users, groups, and roles included in and excluded from the policy.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"Conditions that must be met for the policy to apply.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"created_date_time":{"type":"string","description":"The creation date and time of the policy.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"deleted_date_time":{"type":"string","description":"The deletion date and time of the policy, if applicable.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"display_name":{"type":"string","description":"The display name for the Conditional Access policy.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"grant_controls":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"authentication_strength":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"allowed_combinations":{"type":["set","string"],"description":"The allowed authentication method combinations that satisfy the authentication strength policy.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"created_date_time":{"type":"string","description":"Creation date and time of the authentication strength policy.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"description":{"type":"string","description":"Optional description of the resource. Maximum length is 1500 characters.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"display_name":{"type":"string","description":"Display name of the authentication strength policy.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"id":{"type":"string","description":"ID of the authentication strength policy. Can be a GUID or predefined built-in values: 'multifactor_authentication' (maps to '00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002'), 'passwordless_mfa' (maps to '00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003'), or 'phishing_resistant_mfa' (maps to '00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004').","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"modified_date_time":{"type":"string","description":"Last modified date and time of the authentication strength policy.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"policy_type":{"type":"string","description":"Type of the policy. Possible values are: builtIn, custom.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"requirements_satisfied":{"type":"string","description":"Requirements satisfied by the policy.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"Authentication strength is a Conditional Access control that specifies which combinations of authentication methods can be used to access a resource. Users can satisfy the strength requirements by authenticating with any of the allowed combinations. read more here 'https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity/authentication/concept-authentication-strengths'.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"built_in_controls":{"type":["set","string"],"description":"List of built-in controls required by the policy. Possible values are: block, mfa, compliantDevice, domainJoinedDevice, approvedApplication, compliantApplication, passwordChange, riskRemediation, verifiedID.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"custom_authentication_factors":{"type":["set","string"],"description":"Custom authentication factors for granting access.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"operator":{"type":"string","description":"Operator to apply to the controls. Possible values are: AND, OR. When setting a singular operator, use 'OR'.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"terms_of_use":{"type":["set","string"],"description":"Terms of use required for granting access.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"Controls for granting access. Either `grant_controls` or `session_controls` or both must be specified.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"id":{"type":"string","description":"String (identifier)","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"modified_date_time":{"type":"string","description":"The last modified date and time of the policy.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"partial_enablement_strategy":{"type":"string","description":"Strategy for partial enablement of the policy.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"session_controls":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"application_enforced_restrictions":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"is_enabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Whether application enforced restrictions are enabled.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"Application enforced restrictions for the session.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"cloud_app_security":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"cloud_app_security_type":{"type":"string","description":"Type of cloud app security control. Possible values are: blockDownloads, mcasConfigured, monitorOnly, unknownFutureValue.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"is_enabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Whether cloud app security controls are enabled.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"Cloud app security controls for the session.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"continuous_access_evaluation":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"mode":{"type":"string","description":"Mode for continuous access evaluation. Possible values are: strictEnforcement, disabled, strictLocation.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"Continuous access evaluation controls for the session.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"disable_resilience_defaults":{"type":"bool","description":"Whether to disable resilience defaults.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"global_secure_access_filtering_profile":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"is_enabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Whether global secure access filtering controls are enabled.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"profile_id":{"type":"string","description":"ID of the global secure access filtering profile.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"Global Secure Access filtering profile for the session.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"persistent_browser":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"is_enabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Whether persistent browser controls are enabled.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"mode":{"type":"string","description":"Mode for persistent browser. Possible values are: always, never.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"Persistent browser controls for the session.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"secure_sign_in_session":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"is_enabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Whether secure sign-in session controls are enabled.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"Secure sign-in session controls.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"sign_in_frequency":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"authentication_type":{"type":"string","description":"Authentication type for sign-in frequency. Possible values are: primaryAndSecondaryAuthentication, secondaryAuthentication.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"frequency_interval":{"type":"string","description":"Frequency interval for sign-in frequency. Possible values are: timeBased, everyTime.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"is_enabled":{"type":"bool","description":"Whether sign-in frequency controls are enabled.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"type":{"type":"string","description":"Type of sign-in frequency control. Possible values are: days, hours. Not used when frequency_interval is everyTime.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"value":{"type":"number","description":"Value for the sign-in frequency. Not used when frequency_interval is everyTime.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"Sign-in frequency controls for the session.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description":"Controls for managing user sessions. Either `grant_controls` or `session_controls` or both must be specified.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"state":{"type":"string","description":"Specifies the state of the policy. Possible values are: enabled, disabled, enabledForReportingButNotEnforced.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"template_id":{"type":"string","description":"ID of the template this policy is derived from.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"timeouts":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"create":{"type":"string","description":"A string that can be [parsed as a duration](https://pkg.go.dev/time#ParseDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (m