seDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours).","description_kind":"plain","optional":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description_kind":"plain","optional":true}},"description":"Manages rules within Microsoft Entra Global Secure Access content policies using the Microsoft Graph beta `/networkaccess/filePolicies/{contentPolicyId}/policyRules` endpoint.","description_kind":"markdown"}},"microsoft365_graph_beta_identity_and_access_network_filtering_policy":{"version":0,"block":{"attributes":{"action":{"type":"string","description":"The action to take when the policy is triggered. Possible values are: `block`, `allow`. Note: This is typically set during creation but can also be updated.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"created_date_time":{"type":"string","description":"The creation date and time of the policy.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"description":{"type":"string","description":"Optional description of the resource. Maximum length is 1500 characters.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true,"computed":true},"id":{"type":"string","description":"The unique identifier for the filtering policy.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"last_modified_date_time":{"type":"string","description":"The last modified date and time of the policy.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"name":{"type":"string","description":"The name of the filtering policy.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"timeouts":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"create":{"type":"string","description":"A string that can be [parsed as a duration](https://pkg.go.dev/time#ParseDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours).","description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"delete":{"type":"string","description":"A string that can be [parsed a