rs and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours).","description_kind":"plain","optional":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description_kind":"plain","optional":true}},"description":"Retrieves Cloud PC audit events from Microsoft Intune using the `/deviceManagement/virtualEndpoint/auditEvents` endpoint. This data source is used to query administrative actions and changes for compliance and troubleshooting.","description_kind":"markdown"}},"microsoft365_graph_beta_windows_365_cloud_pc_device_image":{"version":0,"block":{"attributes":{"filter_type":{"type":"string","description":"Type of filter to apply. Valid values are: `all`, `id`, `display_name`. Use 'all' to retrieve all Device Images, 'id' to retrieve a specific Device Image by its unique identifier, or 'display_name' to filter by name.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"filter_value":{"type":"string","description":"Value to filter by. Not required when filter_type is 'all'. For 'id', provide the Device Image ID. For 'display_name', provide the name to match.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"items":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"display_name":{"type":"string","description":"The display name of the Device Image.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"error_code":{"type":"string","description":"Error code if there was an issue with the Device Image.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"expiration_date":{"type":"string","description":"The expiration date of the Device Image.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"id":{"type":"string","description":"The unique identifier for the Device Image.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"last_modified_date_time":{"type":"string","description":"The date and time when the Device Image was last modified.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"operating_system":{"type":"string","description":"The operating system of the Device 