x). Example: `Software\\Policies\\Microsoft\\WindowsStore\\` or `Software\\MyApp\\Settings`. Use double backslashes (`\\\\`) to escape path separators.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"remediation_script":{"type":"string","description":"Generated PowerShell remediation script that creates or updates the registry key and value to the desired state. Use this as the remediation script in Intune Proactive Remediations.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"timeouts":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"read":{"type":"string","description":"A string that can be [parsed as a duration](https://pkg.go.dev/time#ParseDuration) consisting of numbers and unit suffixes, such as \"30s\" or \"2h45m\". Valid time units are \"s\" (seconds), \"m\" (minutes), \"h\" (hours).","description_kind":"plain","optional":true}},"nesting_mode":"single"},"description_kind":"plain","optional":true},"value_data":{"type":"string","description":"The desired value data. Format depends on value_type:\n  - `REG_SZ`, `REG_EXPAND_SZ`: String (e.g., 'Enabled')\n  - `REG_DWORD`: Decimal integer (e.g., '1', '0', '255')\n  - `REG_QWORD`: Decimal integer (e.g., '1234567890')\n  - `REG_MULTI_SZ`: Multiple strings separated by newlines\n  - `REG_BINARY`: Hexadecimal string (e.g., '01AF3C')","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"value_name":{"type":"string","description":"The name of the registry value to manage. Use `(Default)` for the default value of a key.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"value_type":{"type":"string","description":"The registry value type. Valid values:\n  - `REG_SZ`: String value\n  - `REG_DWORD`: 32-bit integer value\n  - `REG_QWORD`: 64-bit integer value\n  - `REG_MULTI_SZ`: Multi-string value (separate strings with newlines)\n  - `REG_EXPAND_SZ`: Expandable string value (can contain environment variables)\n  - `REG_BINARY`: Binary data (provide as hex string, e.g., '01AF3C')","description_kind":"markdown","required":true}},"description":"Generates PowerShell detection and remediation scripts locally for Intune Proactive Remediations. This data source is used to create standardized registry key management scripts with proper error handling and exit codes.","description_kind":"markdown"}}},"ephemeral_resource_schemas":{"microsoft365_graph_beta_multitenant_management_audit_event":{"version":0,"block":{"attributes":{"filter_type":{"type":"string","description":"Type of filter to apply. Valid values are: `all`, `id`, `display_name`, `odata`.","description_kind":"markdown","required":true},"filter_value":{"type":"string","description":"Value to filter by. Not required when filter_type is 'all'.","description_kind":"markdown","optional":true},"items":{"nested_type":{"attributes":{"activity":{"type":"string","description":"A string that describes the activity that was performed.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"activity_date_time":{"type":"string","description":"The date and time when the activity was performed.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"activity_id":{"type":"string","description":"The identifier of the activity request that made the audit event.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"category":{"type":"string","description":"A category that represents a logical grouping of activities.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"http_verb":{"type":"string","description":"The HTTP verb that was used when making the API request.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"id":{"type":"string","description":"Unique identifier for the audit event.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"initiated_by_app_id":{"type":"string","description":"The identifier for the app that was used to make the request.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"initiated_by_upn":{"type":"string","description":"The UPN of the user who initiated the activity.","description_kind":"markdown","computed":true},"initiated_by_user_id":{"type":"string","description":"Th